OL,3,GNEWSAStudent 'rewatched CCTV of him
OL,4,Akilling housemate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who stabbed his housemate to
OL,7,Fdeath says he rewatched the CCTV
OL,8,Ffootage of the attack five times in an
OL,9,Fattempt to "make sense of it all".
OL,11,FZack Coughlan, 23, admits dressing in a
OL,12,Fblack ski mask and gloves to ambush
OL,13,FJamie Collins, 21, stabbing him 32
OL,14,Ftimes in the garden of their home in
OL,15,FBristol on 8 April.
OL,17,FCoughlan denies murder on the grounds
OL,18,Fhe feared for his life, claiming
OL,19,FCollins' political views became more
OL,20,Fextreme and he had allegedly made
OL,21,Fthreats to kill him.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
