OL,3,GNEWSAStudent 'rewatched CCTV of him
OL,4,Akilling housemate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the trial at Bristol Crown
OL,7,FCourt, Coughlan said stabbing his
OL,8,Fformer friend was a "very last moment"
OL,9,Fdecision, adding: "I tried to think of
OL,10,Fanother solution."
